WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Hubert Gaffney: Good evening everyone, welcome to the Saturday class. Tonight we start with the strike price targets for TSM and NVDA.

2
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:16.000
Hubert Gaffney: TSM closed above its break of level on Friday, so the call target stays in place for the week.

3
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:24.000
Hubert Gaffney: NVDA is sitting right on the median of its channel, which is why we wait for a close outside the channel before we act.

4
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:30.000
Ava Martin: Do we use the 4 PM close or the after-hours price for the break of level?

5
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:38.000
Hubert Gaffney: Always the 4 PM close. After-hours prices move on thin volume, so they do not count for the break of level.

6
00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:46.000
Hubert Gaffney: For homework before next class, mark the channel lines on AAPL and write down where the next BOC sits.
